  "Every paper is filed by what it will do in your argument. The estimate, the one that cuts against it, the method behind both.": "688e42abadaf9d8a.mp3",
  "You do not have to read forty abstracts to find out. Ask any paper why it matters, and Firmo answers against your question, not in general.": "86cc8741edd8eb66.mp3",
  "Keep the ones you will actually use. They collect on the shelf beside you.": "822c54067c71f596.mp3",
  "Four sources is enough for Firmo to plan the argument.": "d5911ab140e76ca9.mp3",
  "Or just ask them. Grounded in the papers you kept, not the open internet — and it will explain and plan, but never write your paragraphs.": "79a2e367766c0b74.mp3",
  "The page is yours. Firmo does not write it.": "0fb9d0b9634e682e.mp3",
  "Now it reads what you wrote and marks every sentence a reader will expect a source for.": "651fec24bfb70510.mp3",
  "Red means the evidence you saved disagrees with what you wrote. Firmo shows you what it actually says.": "9cec90232ad39313.mp3",
